{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "ztrans", "ucas": "ztrans a^n", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ztrans", "region_of_convergence": "|z| > abs(a)", "roc": "|z| > abs(a)", "one_sided": "x[n] for n >= 0", "rules": "a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)", "lhs": "Z{a^n}(z)", "value": "z/(z - a)", "headline": "Z{a^n}(z) = z/(z - a)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (88 terms) at z = 17/10, 17/5, 71/10 with a = 7/10: max relative difference 2e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "Z{a^n}(z) = z/(z - a)\n  region of convergence: |z| > abs(a)\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (88 terms) at z = 17/10, 17/5, 71/10 with a = 7/10: max relative difference 2e-16\n"}
